                    227.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d125-f2" n="2" xml:id="d125-f2-content">
                <p>Proclamation No. 2237, <hi rendition="#italic">ibid</hi>., May 1, 1937 (vol. <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">xvi</hi>, No. 396), p. 288.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d125-f3" n="2a" xml:id="d125-f3-content">
                <p>Act approved August 31, 1935, with amendments of February 29, 1936, and May 1,
                    1937; 49 Stat. 1081, 1152, and 50 Stat. 121.</p>
            </note>
